@startuml
title Answer a decision and resume the item

actor Owner
participant "avarice decide" as Decide
database Ledger
participant Supervisor
participant "Run clone" as Clone
participant "Claude Code host" as Host

note over Ledger : a decision is open, its item is blocked_on_decision,\nits delta is parked in the clone, the run is blocked_on_decision\n(or a supervisor is working other items)

== Who may answer ==
Owner -> Decide : decide DECISION with an option key or text
alt inside a run, no terminal, or from a run's process tree
  Decide --> Owner : refused (64), before the profile is resolved,\nnothing read, nothing written
else not the user who owns the profile
  Decide --> Owner : refused (64), nothing written
else not refused so far
  Decide -> Ledger : read the decision to find its run
  alt open decision, and the host configuration directory\nthe run recorded is missing or unreadable
    Decide --> Owner : refused (3), nothing written, the decision stays open
  else not refused
    Decide -> Ledger : read the latest contract
  end
end

== The checks, in order ==
Decide -> Decide : open? listed option or allowed text? same answer as before?\nstate digest still equal?
alt decision stale, withdrawn or not open
  Decide -> Ledger : decision.rejected (check name only)
  Decide --> Owner : refused (3), the stale one names its successor
else amend-only record answered with an option key other than withdraw
  Decide -> Ledger : amendment.requested
  Decide --> Owner : the amend command, nothing applied (3)
else option not listed, text not allowed or invalid
  Decide -> Ledger : decision.rejected (check name only)
  Decide --> Owner : refused (64)
else same answer to an answered decision
  Decide -> Ledger : decision.duplicate
  Decide --> Owner : ignored (0)
else different answer to an answered decision
  Decide -> Ledger : decision.rejected (check name only)
  Decide --> Owner : refused (3)
else withdraw, applied whatever the state digest says
  Decide -> Ledger : decision withdrawn, items keep their state
else state moved since the question
  Decide -> Ledger : old decision stale with the answer kept,\nsuccessor opened on the new state
  Decide --> Owner : answer not applied, answer the successor (3)
else answer applies
  Decide -> Ledger : decision answered, affected items\nblocked_on_decision to ready (one transaction)
end
note over Decide, Ledger : the pickup and the answered item below follow only a withdraw\nor an answer that applies; every refusal above, in both sections, ends with its message to the owner

== Who picks the run up ==
alt a supervisor holds a live lease, and the run is not blocked or is continuable
  note over Supervisor : its scheduler reads the ledger after every item\nand takes the answered item next
else run blocked on a decision, continuable, no live lease
  Decide -> Supervisor : spawn detached, step supervisor:decide
  Supervisor -> Ledger : take the lease, run blocked_on_decision to running
else nothing continuable (a blocked run with decisions still open, or a run that has stopped or has no live supervisor)
  Decide --> Owner : nothing started
end
Decide --> Owner : exit 0 (answered or withdrawn)

== The answered item ==
Supervisor -> Ledger : scheduler picks the item, context pack step
alt the item has its session, a parked delta and no earlier fallback
  Supervisor -> Ledger : attempt with reason resume
  Supervisor -> Clone : snapshot of the clean tree
  Supervisor -> Ledger : checkpoint unpark
  Supervisor -> Clone : put the parked delta back on the current HEAD
  alt delta conflicts with a later commit, or its ref is gone
    Supervisor -> Ledger : step resume:fallback (unpark-conflict or park-missing)
    Supervisor -> Clone : back to the item base, delta dropped
    Supervisor -> Ledger : next attempt with reason answer
    Supervisor -> Host : fresh unit with the question and the answer
  else delta back in the tree
    Supervisor -> Ledger : launch checkpoint, reserve an invocation, launch step with the session
    Supervisor -> Host : launch resume of the item's own session, the answer as data
    Host -> Clone : edit files
    Host --> Supervisor : result
    alt host does not know the session, or the unit crashed with HEAD unmoved
      Supervisor -> Ledger : step resume:fallback (session-gone or crashed), attempt discarded
      Supervisor -> Clone : back to the item base
      alt invocations budget spent
        Supervisor -> Ledger : decision (budget), run blocked_on_decision
      else
        Supervisor -> Host : fresh unit with the question and the answer (attempt reason answer)
      end
    end
  end
else no session or no parked delta
  Supervisor -> Ledger : attempt with reason answer
  Supervisor -> Host : fresh unit with the question and the answer
end

== Judged as any unit is ==
Supervisor -> Clone : classify against the item base
Supervisor -> Ledger : gate G1, gate G2, repair when a required check newly failed, gate G3
alt unit asks again, or gate G1, gate G3 or gate G2 (other than scope) fails
  Supervisor -> Ledger : park, new decision for the item
else gate G2 scope or deletion scope fails, HEAD moved, budget spent or host refused
  Supervisor -> Ledger : run blocked, nothing parked
else gates pass
  Supervisor -> Clone : drop the park ref, commit the item
  Supervisor -> Ledger : item done, next item or verifying
end
@enduml
